# Line endings are part of what this repository claims.
#
# The contract's bytes are hashed, deployed and compared against the chain, so
# a working copy that swaps LF for CRLF produces a file that hashes differently
# on one machine than another -- and "byte-identical to the deployed bytes"
# stops meaning anything the moment it depends on who checked it out.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ico binary
